<!-- Problem statement — keep original copy src/index.erb:13-14 -->
<section id="problem" class="card-hero m-0 mb-4" aria-labelledby="problem-heading">
  <h2 id="problem-heading" class="visually-hidden">The problem we solve</h2>
  <p class="fs-4">
    Stop juggling spreadsheets, sticky notes, and group chats.
    GatherPack gives your organization one home for members, events, finances, and communication,
    and makes that information accessible to everyone, not just the handful of people who happen to know where things are.
  </p>
  <p class="fs-5 mt-3 mb-0">
    GatherPack handles member management, event scheduling, bookkeeping, announcements and more,
    and it's flexible enough to work for a 10-person club or a 500-person nonprofit.
    GatherPack is free and open source, with managed hosting and support services available if you'd rather not run it yourself.
  </p>
</section>

