            <p>Group members into teams to control what they can see and who gets which messages. No more reply-all disasters.</p>
            <h4>Managers</h4>
            <p>Give team leads the ability to manage their own content, events, and members without handing them the keys to everything.</p>
            <h4>Badges</h4>
            <p>Recognize achievements, track certifications, or just have a little fun rewarding your members.</p>
