            <h4>Check-In &amp; RSVPs</h4>
            <p>Let people RSVP or sign up for volunteer shifts. Attach custom fields to track whatever your event requires, like roles, hotel assignments, or t-shirt sizes.</p>
            <h4>Time Tracking &amp; Attendance</h4>
